  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Straws in the Wind** (1 other source): The performance included quotes from Phantom Island and chanting about Palestine [1]\n- **Superposition** (1 other source): The performance marked the first time this specific track was played publicly [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Superposition**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-06-06.tora.m5** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 137 min [1]\n- **kglw2025-06-06**: source not stated; 17 songs; 136 min [2]\n- **kglw2025-06-06.SBD.flac**: soundboard; 0 songs; 135 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-06-06.tora.m5**: taped by Tora Tapes; transferred by Jamie Downsworth; source: Røde M5 > Zoom F3 [1]\n- **kglw2025-06-06**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK Thor > PMD661 > 24/96 wav [2]. Also: Recorded using an ADK Thor microphone in ORTF configuration, eight and a half feet high; Audio was processed through a PMD661 recorder and converted to 24-bit, 96kHz WAV [2]\n- **kglw2025-06-06.SBD.flac**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: SBD [3]. Also: The soundboard recording was captured by the band's official sound crew members [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2025-06-06 Lycabettus Theatre, Athens, Greece](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-june-6-2025-lycabettus-theatre-athens-greece.html) [5]",
